# Cloudflare DNS for vyltzero.com — applied by .github/workflows/dns.yml
# (idempotent upsert via scripts/cloudflare-dns.sh).
#
# name                 type   content            proxied
#
# NOT here — the vault rings int/test/acc/app.vyltzero.com. Each is an NS
# delegation to ns1/ns2.nebuladns.net with health-driven lon1 <-> lon2 DNS
# failover (nebula-dns-failover). Owned by bwalia/diy-tax-return-infra:
#   scripts/nebuladns-cloudflare-dns.py      Cloudflare NS delegation
#   ansible/files/zones/<host>.toml          NebulaDNS zones (apex A, TTL 30)
#   ansible/files/nebuladns/dns-failover.toml  failover controller hostnames
# Never add a CNAME/A for those names here: it would collide with the NS.
#
# Marketing site (www/, GitHub Pages via .github/workflows/pages.yml). The
# apex CNAME is served by Cloudflare CNAME flattening; Pages redirects it to www.
www.vyltzero.com       CNAME  bwalia.github.io   false
vyltzero.com           CNAME  bwalia.github.io   false
